The '''Remnant of Ba-Ba''' is an item obtained from the [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid. It is used on the [[Tumeken's guardian]] [[pet]] to allow it to [[Metamorphosis|metamorphose]] into [[Babi]].

In order to receive one from the [[Chest (Tombs of Amascut)|reward chest]], players must complete a raid at level 450+ with zero deaths for all party members, whilst having all invocations for [[Ba-Ba]] enabled. Furthermore, players must defeat her at path level 4 or higher.

